 r←commandRequestBody rqbContent;comp
 :If {6::0 ⋄ (2=⍵.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref')∨2=⍵.(⍎⊃⎕NL ¯9).schema.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref'}rqbContent
